  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/bit_field" target="_blank">bit field</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) of parcel flags (PARCEL_FLAG_*) for the parcel that includes the point <b>pos</b>.</p>
</p>
